      "description": "Compact object rows with a quiet hover and persistent selected fill; row geometry is shared by the sidebar.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Objects\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-nav-item ds-active\" aria-current=\"true\"><span class=\"ds-nav-name\">Button</span><span class=\"ds-nav-count\">4</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-nav-item\"><span class=\"ds-nav-name\">Card</span><span class=\"ds-nav-count\">6</span></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:var(--font-ui,SUIT,Geist,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);min-width:180px}.ds-nav-item{position:relative;width:100%;height:30px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-align:left;background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:5px;padding:5px 9px;color:var(--ink-secondary,#525a68);font-family:var(--font-ui,SUIT,Geist,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);font-size:12px;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-name{overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}.ds-nav-count{margin-left:auto;font-size:10px;color:var(--ink-tertiary,#646e7e);font-weight:450;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-nav-item:hover{background:var(--surface-hover,#eff1f5);color:var(--ink,#20242d)}.ds-nav-item.ds-active{background:var(--accent-soft,#eeecfc);color:var(--accent-ink,#493eba);font-weight:600}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus,#6b5ce6);outline-offset:3px}@media(max-width:720px){.ds-nav-item{height:36px;font-size:13px}}"
